menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_CAMERA_VISION
    bool "Enable camera vision tasks"
    depends on FEATURE_CAMERA_CAPTURE
    default n
    help
        Enables on-device vision tasks (object recognition, picture-book
        recognition, and photo Q&A) that consume camera_capture frames. Every
        task re-checks guardian image-upload consent; results carry only
        bounded symbolic labels.

endmenu
